SUMMARY:The Moon occults Jupiter
DESCRIPTION:Jupiter disappears at 14:38:45 and reappears at 15:11:10 EAT\, 
 seen from Kampala\, UG.\nThe Moon is 10° up in the WNW · daylight\, Sun 
 +59°.\nTimes against the real lunar limb.\nMap\, timings and the view at 
 the Moon's edge: https://occult.alokm.com/jupiter-2026-10-06?city=Kampala%
 2C%20UG
URL:https://occult.alokm.com/jupiter-2026-10-06?city=Kampala%2C%20UG
